arms the two damage-flash timers [di+0xcc]/[di+0xcd]=3 unless [di+0x3d]&0xe0.  Ghidra deref'd param_1 as
a host pointer -> SIGSEGV; rebased to the DGROUP model.  Mission-cascade only.
